WEBVTT

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:07.770
<i>Gawain, why are you
rejecting Lucca?</i>

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.780
<i>Tell me how you feel!</i>

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.160
Ash! Above you!

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:43.310
Ash!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.530
I'm sorry.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.290
I failed.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.410
No worries. I'm just glad
you're not hurt.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.780
Still, his opposition is so fierce.

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.310
It's absolutely pointless
to try talking to him.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:37.300
If we only knew why Gawain
was rejecting Lucca...

00:02:37.580 --> 00:02:40.300
The upcoming training camp
would've been a good chance

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.510
for the two of them
to reconnect. But now...

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:47.480
At this rate, Lucca may
not even attend.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.600
Rebecca?

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.570
May I have permission to
enter Meabh House?

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:57.790
I'd like to speak with
Lucca one more time.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.700
What?! What have you
got up your sleeve?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.100
All right. You may go.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:02.820
Huh?

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.290
But take Eco with you.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:10.080
It's unseemly for a man to be alone in the women's dorm.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.820
Thank you so much!

00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.790
Now wait just a minute!

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.840
I don't recall agreeing
to come along!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.830
Gawain...

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.460
It's Ash Blake from
the Student Council.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:05.430
May I come in?

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:06.990
Huh?

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.940
Please, have some tea.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:22.110
I wasn't able to get Gawain
to tell me how he felt.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:22.950
I'm sorry.

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:24.670
Ah.

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:29.520
U-Um, you're attending
the camp, right?

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:34.040
They say the nearby Nog Woods has been a kind of dragon health resort for eons.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.440
If you go there, I bet Gawain will get better in no time.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:43.510
And they say a change of scenery can do a lot of good too.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:51.020
I'd like you to face
Gawain one more time.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.660
Pal and breeder... It's like...

00:04:56.660 --> 00:04:59.320
It's something irreplaceable.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.410
It's like your destiny.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.110
And that's why...

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.140
Argh! Get off the fence already!

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.280
E-Eco?!

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.080
You stupid, nitwitted humans

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.940
and all your pointless worrying!

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.200
Hey! Cut that out!

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.530
How dare my pet dog
speak to me in such a tone!

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:20.780
I'll crush you!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:24.080
I'll crush you, and you'll
take it and <i>like</i> it!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:27.020
What are you raving about?! This is going <i>way</i> off track!

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:39.860
I'll go.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.360
Huh?

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:43.610
I'll go to the training camp.

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:53.830
Master Milgauss!

00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:58.460
It's good to see you again.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:00.330
When did you return?

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.500
Just recently.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.130
I see you've infiltrated the Academy.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:10.510
Yes, to investigate
Ash Blake and his Pal Eco.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:15.760
I'll be accompanying them to their
training camp as part of the kitchen staff.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:17.280
Training camp?

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:23.610
Ah, yes, the Willingham Mausoleum on the shores of Lake Allonnes.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.360
Yes?

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.360
The ashes of dragons who died young are buried there.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.370
Though young, they're not lacking as material for experiments.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.540
We'll meet up there.

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.630
Stay close on their heels until then.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.430
Yes, sir.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:52.500
So you <i>have</i> been born among us,
descendant of Avalon.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.400
Eco, huh?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.850
That's quite an ironic name your master has given you.

00:06:57.110 --> 00:06:58.120
Still...

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:04.830
No matter what name you've been given, it's far better than being killed.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.580
Don't you agree...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.130
Julius?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:15.620
Now we're setting off
for camp at Lake Allonnes!

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.370
And here we go!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.630
I heard Gawain has gone ahead.

00:07:33.630 --> 00:07:34.750
Don't worry.

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:38.140
He's a smart one. I'm sure
he'll go straight to the resort.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.270
Uh-huh.

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:43.600
Don't even think about
riding my Arianrhod.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:48.310
Yeah, yeah. Look, I'm not even touching your dragon, okay?

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.940
Hey, not so tight!

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:52.150
S-Sorry!

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:54.160
Off you go!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.650
Lancelot, we're gonna get to
Lake Allonnes first!

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:01.010
Hey! Don't boss him around!

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:03.060
And Lancelot, don't listen to her!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:07.440
He's a good dragon. He respects me!

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:09.140
Isn't that right, Lancelot?

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:15.510
Between you and Ash, I hardly know what's going on anymore.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.880
Wh-What are you doing, Eco?

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.740
Wow! They're so big and soft!

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.280
Mmm, nice and bouncy!

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.340
H-Hey, now, cut that out!

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:31.610
That Ash... I always see him staring at your chest, and Rebecca's too!

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.980
Even though he doesn't seem to care about mine at all.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:34.910
It ticks me off!

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.050
A-Ash looks at my...

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:40.670
There must be some
male-bewitching magic involved.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:43.130
It's high time I got to
the bottom of this!

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.730
No, just stop that!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.430
Th-That's enough, Eco!

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:58.510
Now then.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:01.150
Camp is about to begin.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:06.070
Your experiences over these next few days will have a huge impact on your futures.

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:08.860
All of the Sacred Dragonars of Lautreamont

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.800
completed their training here with flying colors.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.730
If you wish to be among their ranks,

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.780
I want to see your fighting spirit as you aim for the top.

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.050
<i>Everyone's so serious.</i>

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:24.870
You should rest today to prepare for tomorrow's training.

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:27.960
That is, you <i>should</i>.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.750
However, since we're here, I suppose
I could permit a little splashing around.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.940
Take that!

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:59.280
Huh? Where are you going, Professor?

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.700
It's a secret.

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.110
Jessica?!

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:16.430
Come now, Sir Ash, let's go!

00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:17.800
G-Go? Where to?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.800
On our honeymoon, of course!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.310
Hey, now, Cosette.

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.810
You don't really mean for me to...

00:10:30.050 --> 00:10:31.560
But of course.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:34.370
It's certain you'll have
all eyes on you.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.860
Well, I don't actually want...

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.320
It's <i>certain</i>, miss.

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:40.820
No, it's just that...

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.530
If you continue to be unreasonable,

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:47.330
I'm afraid I will have to
change you into it by force.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:49.830
W-Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.930
This must be heaven!

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.940
I get to see the Student Council
prez in her swimsuit?

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.760
Now I can die happy!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:09.080
Look! Here comes the princess!

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:16.520
D-Don't you think this suit
is just a bit too skimpy?

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.940
I can't relax with the breeze whipping my flesh like this.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.440
Not to worry.

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.920
I'm sure Master Ash will be very pleased.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.280
Wh-What? Ash?
Why would you bring him up?

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.610
Please, stop!

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:36.880
This isn't half of what my Pal
Rhiannon is capable of!

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.390
Lancelot... and Eco?!

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:46.510
I'm borrowing your Pal.

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.770
W-Wait. Why?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.820
I'm gonna stop that
Jessica in her tracks.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:53.900
After all, <i>I'm</i> Ash's master, not her.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.160
Th-That's not what I meant!

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:57.860
Well, come on.

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.030
Are you with me or what?

00:12:03.020 --> 00:12:04.030
I'm coming too!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.030
That a girl!

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.200
Hey! Wait!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.750
Jessica!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:14.010
Help me!

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.560
Oh, my aching body.

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:40.550
Too much horsing around today.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.360
Lucca?

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.140
Whoa, look at that mud.

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.840
This must be the way.

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:15.600
Gawain...

00:13:15.970 --> 00:13:19.300
Hey, won't you talk to me?

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:25.610
I was so happy when
you became a Maestro.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.620
I wanted us to be together
forever and ever.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.120
So please,

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.100
let's go back to the way we...

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:53.580
Why?

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:57.360
Why? Why won't you say anything?

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.800
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.400
You know, I'm a little ticked off.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.860
We keep trying to talk to you,

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:09.950
but you just brush us off.

00:14:10.470 --> 00:14:11.950
Isn't that right, Gawain?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.610
Stop. You can't...

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:14.750
So that means...

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.830
I'm going to have to force
those feelings out of you!

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.140
<i>Without my Arch, I can't
afford to take even a single hit.</i>

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.890
Over here, Gawain!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.700
No, stop it!

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:10.880
<i>All right! And now...</i>

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:24.020
<i>S-Some kind of reflection
magic? For defense?</i>

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:28.310
<i>Is he mistaking my ability for an attack?</i>

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:34.010
No!

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:38.720
<i>If I leave him like that, he'll die.</i>

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:41.790
<i>Punishment for getting in
Master Milgauss's way.</i>

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.880
Wh-What should I do?

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:55.930
Hands off!

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:59.320
His life's in danger.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.800
I'll handle this. You go get help!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:02.520
And you are...

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.020
Just hurry! Go!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.780
Uh, okay!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.310
Now we're even.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.160
Wh-Where am I?

00:16:23.070 --> 00:16:25.670
Hello, sleepyhead.

00:16:27.280 --> 00:16:28.960
N-Navi?!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.290
This is the Highdragon Workshop,

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.800
a special place that
only the spirit may enter.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:40.440
I summoned you here
to tell you how he feels.

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.310
What? Who is this?

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.440
Gawain.

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:47.480
This thing?!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:52.830
He may be a Maestro, but he's still emotionally immature.

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:54.490
Hence this form.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:58.220
He's apologizing to you.

00:16:58.220 --> 00:17:03.620
He says his back belongs only to
his master, Lucca, so he got serious.

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.620
I see.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:08.130
That's not all.

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:11.440
Three months ago,

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:16.160
Lucca Sarlinen fell off
Gawain while riding him.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.640
She did? Three months ago?

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.940
Have you heard of the Dragon Dance?

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:21.890
No.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:25.710
It's a secret Ecbladian art passed down through generations.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:31.150
Mastery requires natural
talent and unflagging effort.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.650
While she was practicing that,
there was an accident.

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:40.440
She's had an unconscious fear of riding her dragon ever since.

00:17:40.440 --> 00:17:44.050
In that state, it could be
deadly for her to ride,

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:48.920
and so Gawain has been rejecting her,

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.280
even if it means breaking their bond

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.920
and cutting himself off from the astral flow.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.400
Gawain...

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:59.930
You'd go so far as to put your own life on the line to protect Lucca?

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:05.930
But Gawain has only five days left to live.

00:18:06.260 --> 00:18:07.050
Huh?

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:09.940
Wh-What's this?

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.440
It seems the time has come.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.100
Good luck.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:20.260
I'm sure you can restore their bond.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:23.700
And I look forward to
seeing how you turn out,

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.950
knight of Avalon.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:34.590
I hope you can ride me soon.

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.340
Is this... the infirmary?

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:42.970
Fafnirite?

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.470
Oh, right... from the healing magic.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:02.950
Wh-Why are you...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.940
Your temperature was dropping, so I thought I'd warm you up.

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:09.440
U-Um, thanks.

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:13.540
Oh hey, Lucca, I talked to Gawain.

00:19:13.850 --> 00:19:14.670
Huh?

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:17.370
I don't know if you'll believe me, but...

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:25.450
All to protect me?

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:29.680
Yeah. He was thinking
about you this whole time.

00:19:30.420 --> 00:19:33.160
And now, because of
what I've done...

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:34.190
Get a hold of yourself!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.420
Gawain's not long for this world.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.690
He has five days left at most.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.450
This is... the sixth day of camp.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.820
Already?!

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:45.210
You've got to get to
Gawain right away.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.500
You have to think about
him now and only him.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:49.330
Just like he was thinking about you.

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:57.340
O-Okay.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:20.110
Could this be...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:24.040
a hidden dragonkind chamber?
How marvelous!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.120
The fruit of their history and culture.

00:20:31.860 --> 00:20:32.810
It can't be.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.620
The Old Covenant?

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.560
I thought this was banned ages ago.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:44.670
"Two great bloodlines broke off from the wise dragon king Imbolc,

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:48.880
the sacred empire of Avalon and
the dark kingdom of Nehalennia."

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:51.990
"These two houses fought
one another unceasingly."

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:55.400
All that really happened
in the Zono Toen era.

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:59.020
You're those Imperial-

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.050
Stop. Your power is no match for mine.

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:04.780
It's always been that way, hasn't it...

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:06.280
Ann?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:09.030
Th-That nickname!

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:18.780
Prince... Julius?

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:26.610
What now?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.550
I don't care. Kill her.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.050
Master Milgauss?!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:33.060
Damn you.

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.600
You think you can stand in my way?

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:41.070
Leave her. Instead...

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:44.070
I will unleash the Necromancia.

00:21:44.380 --> 00:21:45.700
Y-Yes, sir!

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:05.840
Ash!

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.890
Ow! Eco?

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:11.850
You idiot! I thought you were a goner!

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.230
Don't go wandering off where your master can't see you!

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.730
Ow! Ow! That hurts!
I can't breathe! Ouch!

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:19.730
Let her have her way.

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:22.430
She's been worried sick for five days.

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.730
Too worried to sleep, in fact.

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.680
Has she?

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:28.560
I'm sorry, Eco.

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:32.780
Thank goodness you've
come back around.

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:38.250
L-Lucca? What is it?

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:41.920
Gawain...

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:43.190
Gawain... He's...

00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:17.280
Cosette Shelley here.

